# One-shot plans

When writing or revising a plan for a non-trivial feature, **read and follow** `.agents/skills/one-shot-plan/SKILL.md`.

- Research, then **one numbered question dump** (not 1–5 drips, not AskQuestion-as-primary).
- **Do not** emit the implementation plan until answers (or “lock defaults”).
- The plan itself has **no open questions** / TBDs / Option A vs B.
- Docs are in-scope per `plans-include-docs.mdc`.
